### Создание брони
POST http://localhost:5070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": 1, "userName": "Amir", "start": "2026-11-28T10:00:00Z", "end": "2026-11-28T11:00:00Z"}

###Бронь со смещением
POST http://localhost:5070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": 1, "userName": "Amir", "start": "2026-11-29T10:00:00+03:00", "end": "2026-11-28T10:30:00+03:00"}

###Конец брони раньше начала 
POST http://localhost:5070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": 1, "userName": "Amir", "start": "2026-11-28T10:00:00Z", "end": "2026-11-28T09:00:00Z"}

###Отсутствие комнаты
POST http://localhost:5070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": 999, "userName": "Amir", "start": "2026-11-28T10:00:00Z", "end": "2026-11-28T09:00:00Z"}

### Брони комнаты
GET http://localhost:5070/reservations?roomId=1

### Удалить комнату с бронями
DELETE http://localhost:5070/rooms/1

### Отменить бронь
DELETE http://localhost:5070/reservations/1

###
GET http://localhost:5070/rooms?page=1&pageSize=5

###
POST http://localhost:5070/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Переговорка Б", "capacity": 8 }

###
POST http://localhost:5070/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 5 }

